    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "urgent care is gonna be so expensive and i dont want to wait around if it's just a minor thing. if i dont take the potassium, are there other things i can do at home to fix the imbalance? like a specific diet or maybe just drinking more coconut water? i really need something i can do right now without a doctor.",
